WEBVTT

01:35.860 --> 01:40.720
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.630 --> 01:43.970
[Episode 13]

01:49.509 --> 01:50.759
Have a taste, Your Highness.

01:50.759 --> 01:51.920
I made them myself.

01:54.310 --> 01:55.570
I'm not fond of sweets.

01:58.120 --> 01:58.789
My bad.

01:59.759 --> 02:01.280
I should've asked first.

02:02.710 --> 02:04.370
Today, Father set our wedding

02:04.760 --> 02:06.710
for ten days from now.

02:07.280 --> 02:08.630
I have a gift for you.

02:14.000 --> 02:14.750
This is the only thing

02:14.750 --> 02:16.120
my birth mother left me.

02:16.710 --> 02:17.750
My brother said

02:18.590 --> 02:19.520
it counts

02:19.560 --> 02:20.620
as her dowry for me.

02:23.840 --> 02:25.300
We'll each keep one piece.

02:34.750 --> 02:36.030
May it carry her blessing

02:36.030 --> 02:37.340
from above

02:37.960 --> 02:40.090
to keep you safe and well all your life.

02:42.430 --> 02:43.030
Thank you.

02:44.079 --> 02:45.079
Besides this,

02:45.470 --> 02:46.400
there's another thing

02:46.400 --> 02:47.730
I need to explain to you.

02:48.470 --> 02:49.250
This time,

02:49.470 --> 02:50.280
my brother

02:50.310 --> 02:51.600
made you stay in Susha,

02:51.750 --> 02:52.950
but it wasn't my wish.

02:53.800 --> 02:54.800
After the wedding,

02:54.800 --> 02:55.630
I'll do everything I can

02:55.630 --> 02:57.560
to persuade Father to let us leave.

02:58.030 --> 02:58.960
Please don't hold it

02:58.960 --> 02:59.960
against me

03:00.060 --> 03:01.990
or grow suspicious because of it.

03:02.000 --> 03:02.800
You're overthinking.

03:02.800 --> 03:03.710
Am I really?

03:04.800 --> 03:06.320
I can see whether you're

03:06.470 --> 03:07.470
upset or pleased.

03:09.960 --> 03:11.010
From now on,

03:12.070 --> 03:13.030
I'll always

03:13.030 --> 03:14.240
stay by your side

03:14.560 --> 03:15.630
and serve you as your wife

03:15.630 --> 03:16.760
and your right hand.

03:17.870 --> 03:19.630
Whether our two countries
are at war or peace,

03:19.630 --> 03:20.760
in good times or bad,

03:21.079 --> 03:21.960
I'll never break

03:21.960 --> 03:23.560
the promise I've made today.

03:27.310 --> 03:28.440
You're so kind to me.

03:28.960 --> 03:30.250
I've no way to repay it.

03:32.000 --> 03:33.130
Hearing you say that

03:34.079 --> 03:35.210
puts my mind at ease.

03:37.680 --> 03:38.740
It's getting late.

03:39.240 --> 03:40.960
You'd better head back.

03:49.520 --> 03:51.680
Advisor Xiao has been captured
by Feng Suige.

03:51.680 --> 03:53.210
Have you told His Highness?

03:53.520 --> 03:54.840
Let me see him at once.

03:54.850 --> 03:56.100
[Jingming Garden]

03:54.910 --> 03:56.510
I have urgent news to report.

03:56.570 --> 03:57.370
Officer Ning.

03:57.590 --> 03:59.250
His Highness already knows.

03:59.430 --> 04:00.630
He asked me to tell you

04:00.710 --> 04:01.590
that everything

04:01.590 --> 04:03.520
must wait until after the wedding.

04:05.080 --> 04:07.250
There were Jinxiu's undercover guards
lying in wait on the way.

04:07.250 --> 04:08.310
And they knew

04:08.340 --> 04:09.860
they couldn't make a move in Yujing City,

04:09.860 --> 04:12.060
so they used those children

04:12.120 --> 04:13.050
to force her out.

04:14.120 --> 04:15.360
As for who has the power

04:15.360 --> 04:17.390
to command those undercover guards,

04:17.390 --> 04:18.480
you don't need me

04:18.480 --> 04:19.880
to tell you, do you?

04:21.890 --> 04:25.130
[Pub]

04:50.740 --> 04:51.260
What?

04:52.159 --> 04:53.190
Thinking of putting an arrow

04:53.190 --> 04:55.390
straight through Xia Jingshi's heart?

04:55.630 --> 04:57.890
Seems the famed Jinxiu general's thirst

04:58.120 --> 04:59.450
for vengeance is no lie.

05:00.290 --> 05:01.690
You captured Xiao Weiran

05:02.310 --> 05:03.970
and told Ning Fei everything.

05:04.510 --> 05:06.160
It's even worse than killing them.

05:06.160 --> 05:07.120
How vicious.

05:08.800 --> 05:10.630
The bond
between the Three Heroes of Jinxiu

05:10.630 --> 05:12.360
has become a toy in your hands.

05:13.190 --> 05:16.000
If I didn't do this,
how else could I get the truth?

05:16.510 --> 05:17.630
If you've got a better way,

05:17.630 --> 05:18.800
I'll hear it.

05:24.540 --> 05:25.190
Let go.

05:27.080 --> 05:28.040
I said let go!

05:28.510 --> 05:31.170
Why do something
that grieves those close to you

05:31.310 --> 05:32.770
and pleases your enemies?

05:32.800 --> 05:34.800
My affairs are none of your concern.

05:35.480 --> 05:36.940
I'll make them my concern.

05:37.390 --> 05:38.440
Let go!

05:43.220 --> 05:45.730
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

05:46.220 --> 05:49.130
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

05:47.680 --> 05:49.480
Ever since I fell off that cliff,

05:49.610 --> 05:51.909
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

05:49.730 --> 05:51.460
I've lived for only two things:

05:51.830 --> 05:53.150
to find out who wants to kill me

05:52.270 --> 05:55.840
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

05:53.510 --> 05:54.480
and why.

05:54.900 --> 05:56.140
I joined hands with you

05:56.140 --> 05:58.330
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

05:56.800 --> 05:58.400
only for the sake of revenge.

05:58.570 --> 06:02.360
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

05:59.310 --> 06:01.040
Now there's one question left:

06:01.130 --> 06:02.690
why does Xia Jingshi want me dead?

06:02.690 --> 06:08.440
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

06:03.390 --> 06:05.120
Once I've fulfilled my promise

06:05.190 --> 06:05.750
to you,

06:07.260 --> 06:08.650
we'll be even.

06:14.730 --> 06:17.130
I understand how you're feeling right now.

06:18.360 --> 06:19.560
Being abandoned
by everyone close to you

06:19.560 --> 06:20.560
is truly painful.

06:21.920 --> 06:23.970
♪ Love is a trial, harsh and cold ♪

06:24.200 --> 06:27.480
♪ Who crushes the lingering pain for me? ♪

06:24.830 --> 06:26.040
Those who haven't truly lived it

06:26.040 --> 06:27.370
will never understand.

06:28.010 --> 06:33.380
♪ Clouds vanish, rain ceases, seek me ♪

06:28.090 --> 06:29.690
Don't speak of it so lightly.

06:31.800 --> 06:32.920
Do you know why

06:33.950 --> 06:35.070
my father and I

06:35.070 --> 06:35.870
grew distant?

06:39.680 --> 06:41.610
Years ago, my mother was murdered,

06:42.600 --> 06:44.000
and he turned a blind eye.

06:45.159 --> 06:47.159
Not only did he get himself a new empress,

06:47.159 --> 06:48.430
but he also forbade anyone

06:48.430 --> 06:50.290
from mentioning my mother again.

06:51.070 --> 06:53.530
He even forced me
to call the culprit Mother.

06:54.360 --> 06:55.560
And the old nursemaid

06:55.920 --> 06:57.850
who'd been with me since I was born—

06:58.870 --> 07:00.330
to win favor with my enemy,

07:00.830 --> 07:01.920
she tried

07:01.920 --> 07:03.820
to burn me alive in my sleep.

07:09.770 --> 07:11.500
And my swordsmanship teacher…

07:18.480 --> 07:20.750
They all used my trust

07:20.800 --> 07:22.070
and tried every possible way

07:22.070 --> 07:23.440
to kill me.

07:25.610 --> 07:27.430
I suppose this is what they call

07:28.000 --> 07:29.600
being betrayed by everyone.

07:34.280 --> 07:36.140
Unfortunately, I was hard to kill

07:36.250 --> 07:37.050
and survived.

07:44.790 --> 07:46.790
The powerful First Prince of Susha—

07:46.950 --> 07:48.210
exalted

07:48.270 --> 07:49.360
and ruthless—

07:50.080 --> 07:50.840
yet not at all

07:51.890 --> 07:52.720
the glorious figure

07:52.720 --> 07:53.720
others imagine.

07:54.690 --> 07:56.090
That's why staying alive

07:56.360 --> 07:57.560
is what matters most.

07:59.950 --> 08:01.480
Why are you telling me this?

08:02.630 --> 08:03.360
Maybe…

08:05.750 --> 08:07.610
because we share the same misery.

08:26.640 --> 08:27.400
Give me your hand.

08:26.690 --> 08:30.060
♪ Take down the setting sun as my heart ♪

08:30.410 --> 08:34.020
♪ Fold the heaven and earth
to make my wings ♪

08:34.309 --> 08:35.830
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

08:36.250 --> 08:39.950
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

08:40.080 --> 08:41.750
I didn't mean to hurt you just now.

08:41.750 --> 08:44.920
♪ I thought this life
would drift like a solitary sail ♪

08:42.370 --> 08:43.570
If anyone's to blame,

08:43.630 --> 08:45.050
blame yourself for being nosy

08:45.050 --> 08:45.830
and overestimating yourself.

08:45.360 --> 08:48.380
♪ Yet I chanced upon you
in the smoke-filled alleyway ♪

08:48.720 --> 08:51.700
♪ Like a fleeting flower falling into ♪

08:50.270 --> 08:51.120
Even when you apologize,

08:51.120 --> 08:52.270
you're so defiant.

08:52.080 --> 08:54.550
♪ My eyes ♪

08:53.670 --> 08:54.400
Apologize?

08:55.270 --> 08:56.690
♪ Once I was like a frost-edged sword ♪

08:57.130 --> 08:59.020
♪ Sweeping across the battlefield
in gleaming light ♪

08:57.200 --> 08:58.600
You're overthinking it.

08:59.760 --> 09:02.280
♪ Never thought who'd lay me to rest ♪

09:02.560 --> 09:04.130
♪ Once unstoppable and sharp ♪

09:04.350 --> 09:06.270
♪ Now my heart's tied to you ♪

09:07.090 --> 09:09.550
[Zhengnian Hall]

09:09.510 --> 09:10.820
How much did you drink?

09:11.000 --> 09:12.240
This is a medical clinic,

09:12.240 --> 09:13.330
not an inn.

09:13.510 --> 09:14.020
You...

09:18.960 --> 09:19.560
Ning Fei.

09:20.320 --> 09:20.950
Ning Fei!

09:21.590 --> 09:22.270
Ning Fei!

09:22.670 --> 09:23.320
Shunzi.

09:24.600 --> 09:25.270
Fang.

09:25.270 --> 09:25.840
Ning Fei.

09:26.670 --> 09:27.270
Ning Fei.

09:36.080 --> 09:36.480
Maybe

09:36.510 --> 09:38.600
because of what happened
with Xiao Weiran,

09:38.600 --> 09:39.360
these past two days,

09:39.360 --> 09:40.390
I've been remembering

09:40.390 --> 09:41.850
things from my childhood.

09:43.000 --> 09:44.600
The three of us were orphans,

09:44.870 --> 09:47.730
wandering on the streets
and relying on each other.

09:47.750 --> 09:48.240
Later,

09:49.400 --> 09:51.130
we were taken to the death camp.

09:51.840 --> 09:52.840
I remember

09:52.840 --> 09:54.100
being locked in a cell.

09:54.600 --> 09:55.800
With no food or water,

09:56.190 --> 09:57.520
I was cold and starving,

09:57.670 --> 09:59.130
utterly desperate.

09:59.670 --> 10:01.110
Weiran and Ning Fei

10:01.870 --> 10:04.170
risked their lives
to steal a roasted sweet potato

10:04.170 --> 10:06.780
and secretly brought it to me.

10:09.720 --> 10:10.240
Yixiao,

10:11.120 --> 10:12.440
I hid it in my clothes,

10:12.510 --> 10:13.510
so no one found it.

10:13.600 --> 10:15.130
It's still warm. Eat it now.

10:15.200 --> 10:16.440
Yes, hurry and eat.

10:27.780 --> 10:29.910
-We're not hungry.
-We're not hungry.

10:30.390 --> 10:31.390
I'm fine.

10:31.600 --> 10:32.870
You eat it.

10:33.080 --> 10:34.050
Eat it now.

10:34.360 --> 10:34.790
Eat.

10:38.030 --> 10:38.880
Is it good?

10:40.960 --> 10:42.220
If it's good, eat more.

10:49.390 --> 10:50.210
Without them,

10:51.750 --> 10:53.210
I wouldn't be alive today.

10:53.600 --> 10:54.550
So what?

10:56.000 --> 10:57.430
The past is the past.

10:57.960 --> 10:59.760
People's hearts change easily.

11:00.080 --> 11:00.790
Everything

11:00.840 --> 11:02.900
in the world is constantly changing.

11:03.550 --> 11:05.440
People's hearts are even harder to read.

11:05.440 --> 11:06.240
Once

11:06.270 --> 11:07.390
we were enemies.

11:08.320 --> 11:10.650
And now, we're sitting at the same table.

11:11.510 --> 11:12.390
Can the past

11:13.600 --> 11:14.930
really stay in the past?

11:19.000 --> 11:20.330
Don't you want revenge?

11:25.080 --> 11:26.630
You couldn't do it yourself,

11:26.630 --> 11:28.290
and you're here to lecture me?

11:33.910 --> 11:35.650
You'll soon see a good show.

11:36.480 --> 11:38.340
Be sure to watch it when it starts.

11:38.750 --> 11:40.280
If you don't dare to face it,

11:40.630 --> 11:41.760
how can you let it go?

11:59.880 --> 12:00.680
Stop looking.

12:00.910 --> 12:01.970
All of you, get out!

12:03.120 --> 12:04.440
Be good and leave.

12:07.720 --> 12:08.510
Shunzi.

12:11.640 --> 12:12.850
How did you know

12:13.240 --> 12:15.440
to go to Zhengnian Villa to find Master?

12:15.550 --> 12:17.210
It was Brother Weiran.

12:18.670 --> 12:21.390
He said Master had been
taken away by bad people,

12:21.510 --> 12:22.480
got injured,

12:23.330 --> 12:25.790
and might be recovering
at Zhengnian Villa.

12:26.240 --> 12:27.440
When?

12:27.750 --> 12:29.440
Right before you left,

12:29.630 --> 12:30.720
Brother Weiran

12:32.030 --> 12:33.120
told me that.

12:35.920 --> 12:36.750
Don't move!

12:36.770 --> 12:38.360
I haven't finished stitching your wound.

12:38.360 --> 12:38.840
You…

12:40.870 --> 12:42.790
-Brother Ning Fei.
-Brother Ning Fei.

12:42.790 --> 12:43.840
Brother Ning Fei!

12:45.360 --> 12:46.720
-Brother Ning Fei.
-You may tear your wound open.

12:46.720 --> 12:48.320
You idiot, do you want to die?

12:56.080 --> 12:56.940
Your Highness,

12:57.150 --> 12:58.080
Ning Fei is here.

12:58.670 --> 12:59.800
Why is he here again?

13:00.440 --> 13:01.300
Your Highness,

13:01.460 --> 13:02.990
what does he want this time?

13:03.240 --> 13:04.750
He's here for Xiao Weiran.

13:06.240 --> 13:08.150
So he's finally figured it out.

13:19.630 --> 13:20.360
He's inside.

13:20.840 --> 13:22.170
Say what you need to say.

13:37.240 --> 13:37.790
Ning Fei?

13:41.350 --> 13:42.300
Why are you here?

13:42.630 --> 13:43.960
How are things outside?

13:48.960 --> 13:49.920
Say something!

13:50.440 --> 13:51.200
Does His Highness

13:51.200 --> 13:52.460
have a message for me?

13:52.510 --> 13:54.110
I haven't seen His Highness.

13:56.010 --> 13:57.500
Feng Suige sent you?

13:59.200 --> 14:00.860
I have some questions for you.

14:02.510 --> 14:03.840
The day Yixiao fell off the cliff,

14:03.840 --> 14:05.570
you said someone witnessed it.

14:06.080 --> 14:07.240
Who was it?

14:14.110 --> 14:15.030
I see.

14:15.750 --> 14:17.270
It was all your plan.

14:17.840 --> 14:19.360
You told me to pull back the patrols…

14:19.360 --> 14:20.490
Ning Fei, shut up!

14:20.550 --> 14:21.790
I'll kill you!

14:22.720 --> 14:23.820
Why?

14:23.910 --> 14:24.550
Why?

14:24.620 --> 14:25.700
Why?

14:25.790 --> 14:27.240
Why did you try to kill Yixiao?

14:27.240 --> 14:29.240
Answer me! Answer me! Answer me!

14:29.260 --> 14:30.030
Answer me!

14:32.240 --> 14:32.790
Ning Fei!

14:36.960 --> 14:37.830
Let me ask you,

14:38.910 --> 14:41.170
if His Highness ordered Yixiao's death,

14:41.360 --> 14:42.760
would you kill her or not?

14:47.670 --> 14:49.670
On one side was Jinxiu's great cause

14:50.030 --> 14:51.320
and a military order.

14:53.020 --> 14:55.620
On the other side was someone
you saw as family.

14:56.300 --> 14:57.500
How would you choose?

15:07.790 --> 15:09.010
As a soldier,

15:09.830 --> 15:11.160
I must serve my country.

15:11.630 --> 15:12.630
As a subordinate,

15:14.550 --> 15:15.870
I must serve my master.

15:25.200 --> 15:25.730
Ning Fei,

15:26.960 --> 15:28.760
I didn't want you to know all this

15:30.120 --> 15:31.630
because I didn't want you to bear

15:31.630 --> 15:33.030
this heart-eating pain.

15:33.950 --> 15:35.030
I failed Yixiao.

15:36.520 --> 15:37.980
I betrayed my principles.

15:39.440 --> 15:41.240
I deserve to go to hell after I die.

15:41.240 --> 15:42.570
That's my retribution!

15:44.750 --> 15:46.350
But you don't know anything.

15:46.960 --> 15:49.220
None of this had anything to do with you!

15:55.750 --> 15:56.320
Yixiao?

17:40.410 --> 17:41.610
Weiran was right.

17:42.830 --> 17:44.130
As subordinates,

17:44.830 --> 17:46.360
we should serve our master.

17:48.690 --> 17:49.760
If it were me,

17:50.700 --> 17:52.060
maybe I'd be torn too.

17:53.110 --> 17:53.960
In that case…

17:57.830 --> 17:58.830
let's stop making things hard

17:58.830 --> 17:59.720
for each other.

18:03.910 --> 18:05.040
We were family once.

18:06.310 --> 18:08.110
The three of us grew up together,

18:09.240 --> 18:10.370
fought side by side,

18:11.310 --> 18:12.770
and protected each other.

18:14.200 --> 18:15.440
That bond was real.

18:17.030 --> 18:18.090
And that's enough.

18:32.880 --> 18:34.440
I forgot to tell you something.

18:34.440 --> 18:35.070
When we were kids,

18:35.070 --> 18:37.750
you always gave me
the precious sweet potatoes.

18:37.750 --> 18:39.680
I actually didn't like them at all.

18:43.900 --> 18:44.880
I only ate them because

18:44.880 --> 18:46.880
I didn't want to hurt your feelings.

18:46.880 --> 18:47.880
Now it's perfect.

18:48.590 --> 18:50.450
I'll never have to eat them again.

18:59.800 --> 19:00.850
From this day on,

19:01.240 --> 19:03.480
the Three Heroes of Jinxiu are strangers!

19:03.480 --> 19:06.210
Swords will draw blood,
and all ties are severed!

19:06.310 --> 19:06.960
Yixiao.

19:07.270 --> 19:07.850
No.

19:11.640 --> 19:12.830
The great cause of Jinxiu

19:12.830 --> 19:13.590
has nothing to do

19:13.590 --> 19:15.100
with me anymore!

19:15.880 --> 19:16.920
No matter why Xia Jingshi

19:16.920 --> 19:18.000
wants to kill me,

19:18.170 --> 19:18.960
whatever scheme

19:18.960 --> 19:20.120
he's plotting,

19:20.270 --> 19:21.750
I won't let him succeed!

19:23.880 --> 19:25.440
I'll make him pay!

19:47.140 --> 19:48.250
Yixiao, stop!

19:48.400 --> 19:49.600
Don't talk nonsense.

19:50.070 --> 19:51.220
What do you mean by cutting all ties?

19:51.220 --> 19:52.950
With whom are you cutting ties?

19:53.200 --> 19:53.960
Weiran was wrong.

19:53.960 --> 19:54.680
He knows he was wrong.

19:54.680 --> 19:55.740
I apologize to you on his behalf.

19:55.740 --> 19:57.400
Yixiao, don't say things you don't mean.

19:57.400 --> 19:58.460
Yixiao, stop!

19:58.680 --> 20:00.020
His Highness must have forced him.

20:00.020 --> 20:01.440
Weiran always obeys him.

20:01.480 --> 20:02.880
This couldn't have been his choice.

20:02.880 --> 20:03.940
Stop talking!

20:06.200 --> 20:07.040
I understand.

20:07.350 --> 20:09.010
Mistakes have consequences.

20:09.030 --> 20:09.830
A simple apology

20:09.830 --> 20:10.680
isn't enough.

20:11.440 --> 20:11.940
How about this?

20:11.940 --> 20:12.940
I'll go stab him

20:12.970 --> 20:14.030
to make it up to you.

20:14.790 --> 20:16.120
Do you think I want this?

20:17.160 --> 20:18.560
I don't want this either.

20:19.000 --> 20:20.130
Forget it, Ning Fei.

20:20.720 --> 20:21.520
It's useless.

20:23.000 --> 20:23.930
We can't go back.

20:25.640 --> 20:27.160
None of us can go back.

20:28.590 --> 20:29.590
He's not the Xiao Weiran

20:29.590 --> 20:30.450
we used to know.

20:31.480 --> 20:33.340
And I'm no longer the Yixiao I was.

20:37.480 --> 20:39.010
How did we end up like this?

20:41.590 --> 20:43.000
What are we gonna do?

20:44.030 --> 20:44.550
Yixiao,

20:45.480 --> 20:47.280
we promised each other a future.

20:48.000 --> 20:49.000
Are you asking me?

20:50.170 --> 20:51.300
I don't know either.

20:56.480 --> 20:57.240
Yixiao.

21:07.730 --> 21:08.350
Ning Fei!

21:08.430 --> 21:09.150
Ning Fei!

21:09.180 --> 21:10.440
What's wrong with you?

21:11.350 --> 21:11.880
Ning Fei!

21:14.480 --> 21:15.070
Ning Fei!

21:17.720 --> 21:18.510
Your Highness,

21:18.510 --> 21:19.400
I recorded

21:19.440 --> 21:20.570
their conversation

21:20.720 --> 21:21.450
word for word

21:21.550 --> 21:23.080
without missing anything.

21:24.000 --> 21:24.790
It basically confirms

21:24.560 --> 21:25.170
[Xiao: Ning Fei, I had my reasons.]

21:24.790 --> 21:26.110
what Miss Yixiao said earlier.

21:25.200 --> 21:25.890
[Ning: What reasons? We adopted]

21:25.920 --> 21:26.610
[those kids with Yixiao.]

21:26.440 --> 21:27.720
After the Battle of Pingling,

21:27.720 --> 21:28.830
Xia Jingshi and people from Susha

21:28.830 --> 21:29.830
were having a secret meeting in camp.

21:29.830 --> 21:30.680
Maybe Miss Yixiao

21:30.680 --> 21:31.750
overheard something

21:31.750 --> 21:33.270
and argued with Xia Jingshi.

21:33.270 --> 21:34.480
But what it was exactly—

21:34.480 --> 21:35.480
we don't know yet.

21:37.310 --> 21:38.370
As for Xiao Weiran,

21:38.400 --> 21:39.240
do we keep him locked up?

21:39.240 --> 21:39.680
Yes.

21:40.790 --> 21:43.050
Hold him until Xia Jingshi comes for him.

21:43.110 --> 21:43.510
Yes.

21:45.350 --> 21:46.750
By the way, Your Highness,

21:46.750 --> 21:47.590
Ning Fei was badly injured

21:47.590 --> 21:49.050
when fighting Xun Xiang.

21:49.110 --> 21:50.350
He was shaken in prison just now

21:50.350 --> 21:51.080
and fainted.

21:51.400 --> 21:53.030
Miss Yixiao has already taken him

21:53.030 --> 21:54.400
to Young Mistress Ling for treatment.

21:54.400 --> 21:55.610
How is he now?

21:56.110 --> 21:56.970
From what I saw,

21:57.110 --> 21:58.270
his wound is festering.

21:58.270 --> 21:59.600
He seems to be poisoned.

21:59.680 --> 22:01.070
I wonder if Young Mistress Ling is

22:01.070 --> 22:02.070
able to save him.

22:12.960 --> 22:14.820
I need raw Pinellia and Arisaema.

22:27.720 --> 22:28.240
He…

22:30.350 --> 22:31.110
How is he now?

22:32.430 --> 22:33.830
That arrow was poisoned.

22:34.440 --> 22:36.100
It's been left in for too long.

22:36.480 --> 22:37.480
I'm afraid the poison

22:37.480 --> 22:39.160
has already reached his heart and lungs.

22:39.160 --> 22:40.270
It's not that I'm not skilled enough.

22:40.270 --> 22:41.800
Even if my father were here,

22:41.930 --> 22:43.660
he probably couldn't save him.

22:46.920 --> 22:47.440
Then...

22:48.720 --> 22:49.920
how long does he have?

22:50.440 --> 22:51.900
Two or three days, at most.

23:08.550 --> 23:10.610
Where are you going at this late hour?

23:14.680 --> 23:16.370
Meeting Xia Jingshi now

23:16.790 --> 23:18.510
is hardly a wise move.

23:20.200 --> 23:22.400
I heard Ning Fei is gravely wounded
and dying.

23:22.400 --> 23:23.960
I figured you'd storm off in anger

23:23.960 --> 23:25.360
to confront Xia Jingshi.

23:26.640 --> 23:28.440
I'm not here for anything else today,

23:28.440 --> 23:29.410
just to stop you.

23:29.750 --> 23:31.150
Thanks for your concern.

23:31.940 --> 23:33.100
But I need

23:33.400 --> 23:34.930
to face some things myself.

23:36.000 --> 23:36.640
Have you thought about

23:36.640 --> 23:38.170
what to say when you see him?

23:41.790 --> 23:43.400
Are you sure you can get him to reveal

23:43.400 --> 23:45.030
why he wants you dead?

23:45.350 --> 23:46.070
Or do you think

23:46.070 --> 23:47.830
he'll actually tell you the truth?

23:47.830 --> 23:49.180
Whether he does or not,

23:49.450 --> 23:51.180
I want to hear his explanation.

23:51.490 --> 23:52.640
If it weren't for him,

23:52.640 --> 23:53.480
we Three Heroes of Jinxiu

23:53.480 --> 23:55.030
wouldn't have ended up like this.

23:55.030 --> 23:55.690
I'll settle

23:56.160 --> 23:58.160
that score with him sooner or later.

23:59.160 --> 24:00.490
You absolutely should.

24:04.960 --> 24:06.000
But if you're thinking of

24:06.000 --> 24:07.720
killing him today to vent your anger,

24:07.720 --> 24:08.850
I have to remind you—

24:09.480 --> 24:10.270
the royal villa is guarded

24:10.270 --> 24:11.870
by Susha's Imperial Guards.

24:12.440 --> 24:13.000
I know.

24:13.550 --> 24:15.350
Even if you're lucky enough to kill him,

24:15.350 --> 24:16.230
you'll lose your own life

24:16.230 --> 24:17.090
in the process.

24:18.680 --> 24:20.070
Is it really worth it?

24:22.920 --> 24:27.030
[Heaven Coffin Shop]

24:24.510 --> 24:26.570
I decide whether it's worth it or not.

24:27.240 --> 24:27.790
Besides,

24:28.310 --> 24:29.110
we don't just do things

24:29.110 --> 24:30.510
because they are worth it.

24:30.510 --> 24:31.390
You're right.

24:32.000 --> 24:33.140
Some things

24:33.310 --> 24:34.110
are worth

24:34.150 --> 24:35.830
going through hell and high water for.

24:35.130 --> 24:38.830
[Heaven Coffin Shop]

24:36.680 --> 24:37.980
But if you were going to act on impulse,

24:37.980 --> 24:39.640
you would've done it long ago.

24:40.070 --> 24:41.670
You've swallowed your pride

24:41.960 --> 24:42.790
and endured until now.

24:42.790 --> 24:44.180
Wasn't it all to uncover the truth?

24:44.180 --> 24:47.060
[Heaven Coffin Shop]

25:06.030 --> 25:06.590
Your Highness,

25:06.590 --> 25:08.270
I personally went to Zhengnian Hall.

25:08.270 --> 25:08.740
Officer Ning is

25:08.740 --> 25:10.030
indeed badly wounded.

25:10.550 --> 25:11.410
Your Highness,

25:11.790 --> 25:12.530
should we

25:12.590 --> 25:13.730
bring him back?

25:13.530 --> 25:14.930
[Xia Jingshi]

25:17.940 --> 25:19.670
When did the three of them meet?

25:20.800 --> 25:22.200
According to the patrol unit,

25:22.200 --> 25:23.730
it was around noon yesterday.

25:23.730 --> 25:24.550
[Xia Jingshi]

25:23.880 --> 25:25.240
Military Advisor Xiao was locked up

25:25.240 --> 25:25.800
by Feng Suige

25:25.800 --> 25:26.970
in the patrol unit's prison.

25:26.880 --> 25:28.200
[Seal of Xia Jingshi, Prince of Zhennan]

25:27.200 --> 25:28.350
It's surrounded by guards.

25:28.350 --> 25:29.480
Our men can't get in.

25:30.110 --> 25:31.370
Has Yixiao been there?

25:31.510 --> 25:32.160
No.

25:34.270 --> 25:35.300
Take this letter

25:35.480 --> 25:36.240
to Xue Yan.

25:37.270 --> 25:38.060
Tell him

25:38.510 --> 25:39.780
to get Xiao Weiran out

25:39.840 --> 25:41.440
at all costs.

25:41.880 --> 25:42.480
If needed,

25:42.920 --> 25:45.110
he can use the marriage alliance
as leverage.

25:45.110 --> 25:45.640
Yes.

25:53.590 --> 25:54.590
Xia Jingshi only sent someone

25:54.590 --> 25:55.270
to Zhengnian Hall

25:55.270 --> 25:56.470
to ask about Ning Fei.

25:56.640 --> 25:57.480
Other than that,

25:57.480 --> 25:59.140
he hasn't done anything else.

25:59.880 --> 26:01.400
Who would've thought
the Prince of Zhennan

26:01.400 --> 26:02.660
would be so heartless?

26:03.160 --> 26:03.720
Ning Fei has been

26:03.720 --> 26:05.110
through thick and thin with him.

26:05.110 --> 26:06.510
Now that Ning Fei is dying,

26:06.510 --> 26:08.110
he just turns his back on him.

26:08.160 --> 26:09.020
Your Highness,

26:09.110 --> 26:09.880
doesn't he fear

26:09.880 --> 26:11.210
disheartening his men?

26:14.030 --> 26:15.680
I had you leak Ning Fei's condition

26:15.680 --> 26:16.700
to Xia Jingshi

26:17.200 --> 26:18.640
not to see how cold he is

26:18.640 --> 26:19.910
to his subordinates.

26:20.480 --> 26:22.080
Then what's your intention?

26:22.200 --> 26:23.600
If a Jinxiu guard officer

26:23.610 --> 26:25.870
dies in Susha right before the wedding,

26:26.070 --> 26:27.530
regardless of the reason,

26:28.030 --> 26:29.000
it could sabotage

26:29.000 --> 26:30.330
the marriage alliance.

26:31.200 --> 26:31.920
Xia Jingshi

26:31.920 --> 26:33.200
hasn't made a fuss

26:33.240 --> 26:34.560
about Ning Fei,

26:34.720 --> 26:37.720
which means he doesn't want
the alliance ruined either.

26:37.720 --> 26:39.050
So Your Highness thinks

26:39.350 --> 26:41.750
this marriage alliance is
part of his plan?

26:41.960 --> 26:42.310
No.

26:43.310 --> 26:44.160
It wasn't Xia Jingshi

26:44.160 --> 26:45.280
who proposed it.

26:45.680 --> 26:48.010
It was the Emperor of Jinxiu—Xia Jingyan.

26:48.070 --> 26:49.240
At most, Xia Jingshi is using

26:49.240 --> 26:50.900
the marriage for his own ends.

26:51.070 --> 26:52.800
Then what exactly does he want?

26:54.460 --> 26:55.680
Fu Yixiao.

26:57.030 --> 26:58.160
That's why Xia Jingshi came

26:58.160 --> 26:59.220
for this alliance—

26:59.550 --> 27:01.490
to take Fu Yixiao away.

27:23.210 --> 27:24.150
Sister,

27:24.170 --> 27:25.110
stop wiping.

27:25.720 --> 27:27.270
You haven't slept all night.

27:27.270 --> 27:28.420
Go get some rest.

27:28.680 --> 27:29.440
How is he?

27:30.360 --> 27:32.220
I just finished the acupuncture.

27:32.720 --> 27:35.180
Some of the poisoned blood
has been drained.

27:35.360 --> 27:36.790
Will he wake up?

27:37.240 --> 27:40.370
It's already a miracle
that he made it through the night.

27:40.640 --> 27:41.440
There were several times

27:41.440 --> 27:43.170
I couldn't even find his pulse.

27:44.160 --> 27:44.750
Sister,

27:45.110 --> 27:45.830
I'm sorry.

27:46.240 --> 27:47.110
It's all my fault.

27:47.110 --> 27:49.240
My medical skills aren't good enough.

27:49.240 --> 27:50.240
It's all my fault.

27:50.430 --> 27:51.340
Don't say that.

27:52.110 --> 27:53.370
You've done your best.

27:57.400 --> 27:58.240
It's my fault.

27:59.960 --> 28:01.620
I shouldn't have doubted him.

28:01.640 --> 28:03.110
I should've seen from the start

28:03.110 --> 28:05.110
that this had nothing to do with him.

28:05.310 --> 28:07.280
I never should've dragged him into this.

28:07.280 --> 28:10.410
And I definitely shouldn't have
said those harsh words.

28:10.720 --> 28:12.780
Those who want me dead are Xiao Weiran

28:13.200 --> 28:14.340
and Xia Jingshi.

28:15.470 --> 28:16.390
He's never done

28:17.480 --> 28:18.980
anything wrong.

28:21.730 --> 28:23.530
When he was little, he used to say

28:23.960 --> 28:24.920
he wanted a home.

28:25.790 --> 28:27.590
He said we Three Heroes of Jinxiu

28:27.990 --> 28:28.680
should go somewhere

28:28.680 --> 28:30.140
with mountains and rivers

28:30.730 --> 28:32.930
and have a house to grow old in together.

28:33.510 --> 28:34.710
We'll bask in the sun,

28:35.030 --> 28:36.090
grow some flowers,

28:37.180 --> 28:38.910
and stop fighting and killing.

28:40.010 --> 28:41.810
The house doesn't need to be big—

28:42.440 --> 28:44.040
just a place we can call home.

28:47.160 --> 28:48.160
I don't know what else I can do

28:48.160 --> 28:49.030
for him now.

28:53.440 --> 28:54.270
With this,

28:55.510 --> 28:57.440
at least he can finally have a home.

28:59.470 --> 29:03.980
[Zhengnian Hall]

29:01.920 --> 29:02.400
Sir.

29:03.400 --> 29:04.060
We're here.

29:04.310 --> 29:04.970
We're here.

29:07.910 --> 29:10.550
[Ling Feng, Master of Zhengnian Villa]

29:11.020 --> 29:12.050
[Zhengnian Hall]

29:14.240 --> 29:15.350
You fool.

29:15.830 --> 29:17.620
Wake up, Ning Fei.

29:17.960 --> 29:19.110
Ning Fei!

29:19.640 --> 29:20.710
Ling Xueying!

29:22.270 --> 29:22.830
Father!

29:23.310 --> 29:24.140
Let go of him.

29:24.270 --> 29:24.920
Your hands…

29:24.920 --> 29:25.410
Let go.

29:25.580 --> 29:27.040
Let go of him!

29:28.680 --> 29:29.740
What are you doing?

29:29.750 --> 29:30.790
I'm treating him.

29:31.750 --> 29:33.880
Who taught you to treat a patient

29:33.920 --> 29:35.550
while bawling your eyes out like that?

29:35.550 --> 29:36.030
You.

29:36.160 --> 29:37.010
Me?

29:37.240 --> 29:38.760
Give me a break!

29:39.790 --> 29:41.310
Father, save him.

29:41.590 --> 29:43.230
Please help him.

29:46.510 --> 29:47.240
That coffin by the door

29:47.240 --> 29:48.370
is prepared for him?

29:48.640 --> 29:49.480
Well-timed.

29:49.640 --> 29:51.120
We'll be needing it soon.

29:51.590 --> 29:52.030
Father,

29:52.030 --> 29:52.830
please save him.

29:52.830 --> 29:54.200
I'm begging you to save him.

29:54.200 --> 29:54.680
Father.

29:54.750 --> 29:55.970
Save him?

29:56.200 --> 29:57.350
He's already at death's door.

29:57.350 --> 29:58.830
Do you want me to ruin my spotless record?

29:58.830 --> 29:59.560
Come with me.

29:59.790 --> 30:00.310
Father,

30:00.510 --> 30:01.570
what are you doing?

30:01.790 --> 30:03.590
Got any silver on you?

30:03.680 --> 30:05.200
Pay the coachman for me.

30:05.270 --> 30:05.830
My medicine box

30:05.830 --> 30:07.400
is still being held as collateral.

30:07.400 --> 30:08.370
Listen to me.

30:08.400 --> 30:09.270
The box is more important than him.

30:09.270 --> 30:10.300
Hurry, let's go.

30:11.070 --> 30:11.840
Father,

30:11.920 --> 30:13.430
what are you doing?

30:16.350 --> 30:17.950
You paid the coachman for me?

30:18.400 --> 30:19.860
Thank you, Your Highness.

30:20.400 --> 30:21.080
Lord Ling.

30:21.640 --> 30:23.400
I've had people
searching for you all over.

30:23.400 --> 30:24.030
Why has it been

30:24.030 --> 30:25.110
so hard to find you?

30:25.790 --> 30:27.750
A patient asked me
to find some medicine for him.

30:27.750 --> 30:29.010
What do you need me for?

30:29.030 --> 30:30.630
Naturally, I need your help.

30:31.480 --> 30:33.680
I need you to check on a friend's injury.

30:33.880 --> 30:34.920
What kind of friend

30:34.920 --> 30:37.320
deserves such concern
from Your Highness?

30:38.030 --> 30:39.070
She's inside.

30:39.920 --> 30:40.650
Come with me.

30:43.720 --> 30:44.240
Father.

30:44.440 --> 30:44.830
Come.

30:48.880 --> 30:49.880
Clench your fist.

30:51.920 --> 30:52.480
Harder.

30:58.200 --> 30:58.730
Alright.

30:59.200 --> 31:00.200
Let me take a look.

31:01.930 --> 31:03.270
Aside from the injury to your hand,

31:03.270 --> 31:04.530
you also have amnesia.

31:04.550 --> 31:05.980
Falling from that height

31:06.070 --> 31:07.440
and not ending up in pieces,

31:07.440 --> 31:08.790
you must've been caught

31:08.790 --> 31:10.030
by branches on the way down.

31:10.030 --> 31:11.350
They slowed your fall.

31:11.830 --> 31:12.680
As for the amnesia,

31:12.680 --> 31:14.340
since it's from a head trauma,

31:14.830 --> 31:16.880
it means there's a clot in your brain.

31:16.880 --> 31:17.730
The clot

31:17.760 --> 31:19.090
is the real problem.

31:19.480 --> 31:20.830
Torn tendons can be reattached.

31:20.830 --> 31:22.270
As for the clot,

31:22.350 --> 31:23.270
with time and treatment,

31:23.270 --> 31:24.130
it can be fixed.

31:24.880 --> 31:25.400
Yixiao,

31:25.420 --> 31:26.240
I told you

31:26.270 --> 31:28.000
my father would definitely heal you.

31:28.000 --> 31:28.600
Thank you.

31:29.100 --> 31:30.630
I have a difficult request.

31:31.160 --> 31:32.340
My injury is not

31:32.430 --> 31:34.230
worth troubling you, Lord Ling.

31:34.440 --> 31:35.270
I only hope you can

31:35.270 --> 31:36.390
save my brother.

31:36.640 --> 31:37.310
Brother?

31:42.710 --> 31:44.300
That dying man on the bed?

31:45.350 --> 31:46.130
Yes.

31:46.350 --> 31:47.270
Haven't you already prepared

31:47.270 --> 31:48.200
a coffin for him?

31:48.840 --> 31:50.340
Better to bury him soon.

31:50.960 --> 31:51.480
Father,

31:51.920 --> 31:52.750
are you seriously going

31:52.750 --> 31:53.400
to just let him die?

31:53.400 --> 31:54.350
I seriously am.

31:54.720 --> 31:56.070
His pulse is shallow, fading fast,

31:56.070 --> 31:57.750
barely there—
just the signs of heart failure.

31:57.750 --> 31:58.350
It won't be long

31:58.350 --> 31:59.640
before he takes his last breath.

31:59.640 --> 32:00.480
I, Ling Feng, only treat

32:00.480 --> 32:01.740
those who can be saved.

32:01.830 --> 32:03.490
I never fight Hades for a soul.

32:04.480 --> 32:05.520
Lord Ling.

32:05.720 --> 32:06.720
Please, save him!

32:06.740 --> 32:08.180
Yixiao, don't do this.

32:08.790 --> 32:09.220
Father,

32:09.220 --> 32:10.380
Yixiao is my sister.

32:10.400 --> 32:11.030
Her brother

32:11.030 --> 32:11.950
is my brother.

32:12.590 --> 32:14.350
Lord Ling, your skills are unmatched.

32:14.350 --> 32:15.640
There must be another way.

32:15.640 --> 32:16.590
If you can save him,

32:16.590 --> 32:17.440
I'll do anything you ask.

32:17.440 --> 32:18.030
Miss,

32:18.750 --> 32:19.770
rules are rules.

32:19.830 --> 32:20.880
No amount of pleading will change that.

32:20.880 --> 32:21.660
Get up.

32:21.750 --> 32:22.400
I won't.

32:22.650 --> 32:23.270
Lord Ling,

32:23.350 --> 32:24.030
your skills

32:24.070 --> 32:24.880
can work miracles,

32:24.880 --> 32:25.720
and you have a kind heart.

32:25.720 --> 32:26.510
Please, I beg you.

32:26.510 --> 32:27.480
You can't just leave him to die.

32:27.480 --> 32:27.830
Yixiao.

32:27.830 --> 32:28.400
I can!

32:28.920 --> 32:29.520
Lord Ling!

32:31.750 --> 32:32.400
Yixiao.

32:35.110 --> 32:35.680
Father!

32:43.440 --> 32:44.570
Wait for me, Father.

32:45.350 --> 32:46.240
She's my sister.

32:46.240 --> 32:47.270
You must help her.

32:47.440 --> 32:48.400
Zhengnian Hall.

32:51.200 --> 32:52.640
I-I'm in Yujing now.

32:52.720 --> 32:54.400
I need a place to stay, don't I?

32:55.070 --> 32:55.840
Besides,

32:55.960 --> 32:56.830
Zhengnian Villa

32:56.830 --> 32:57.720
having a branch in Yujing

32:57.720 --> 32:59.220
isn't a bad thing, right?

32:59.370 --> 33:00.290
Such a big house

33:00.640 --> 33:01.310
must be expensive.

33:01.310 --> 33:02.840
Where did you get the money?

33:03.040 --> 33:05.100
I put it on the Emperor of Susha's tab.

33:06.320 --> 33:08.070
You foolish girl!

33:08.790 --> 33:10.730
You've got some nerve!

33:12.680 --> 33:13.510
You're driving me crazy.

33:13.510 --> 33:14.880
Father, where are you going?

33:14.880 --> 33:15.810
Where am I going?

33:15.960 --> 33:17.570
You're such a troublemaker!

33:17.610 --> 33:18.540
I have to run.

33:18.720 --> 33:20.000
With all that debt you racked up,

33:20.000 --> 33:21.590
how am I supposed to pay it back?

33:21.590 --> 33:22.120
Also,

33:22.200 --> 33:23.510
that guy is practically
in his grave already,

33:23.510 --> 33:25.010
and you want me to save him?

33:25.110 --> 33:25.920
Why don't you just bury me

33:25.920 --> 33:27.270
with him and be done with it?

33:27.270 --> 33:27.890
Father!

33:30.390 --> 33:31.320
What do you mean?

33:32.240 --> 33:32.840
Lord Ling,

33:33.640 --> 33:34.300
forgive me.

33:40.790 --> 33:42.360
Your Highness, what's the meaning of this?

33:42.360 --> 33:44.110
That girl even knelt to you.

33:45.400 --> 33:46.060
Helping her

33:46.550 --> 33:48.210
would hardly cost you a thing.

33:48.270 --> 33:49.600
She knelt to me. So what?

33:49.920 --> 33:51.780
I could kneel to her too if needed.

33:51.830 --> 33:52.480
Besides,

33:52.510 --> 33:54.710
am I supposed to help everyone who asks?

33:54.830 --> 33:56.750
Those stupid rules of your Zhengnian Villa

33:56.750 --> 33:58.160
should be changed.

33:59.200 --> 34:01.130
Take Lord Ling to the medical hall.

34:01.960 --> 34:02.560
Lord Ling,

34:03.240 --> 34:03.840
please.

34:05.920 --> 34:07.580
Trying to strong-arm me, huh?

34:08.440 --> 34:09.210
Wanna fight?

34:09.230 --> 34:10.389
Don't make me prick you with needles!

34:10.389 --> 34:11.230
-Father!
-Let go of me!

34:11.230 --> 34:12.590
I'm warning you,
I'll prick you with needles!

34:12.590 --> 34:13.469
Let go!

34:24.280 --> 34:24.940
This is my father's

34:24.940 --> 34:26.280
Seven-Aperture Acupuncture.

34:26.280 --> 34:28.139
It can bring the dead back to life.

34:28.400 --> 34:29.659
It looks simple,

34:29.800 --> 34:31.230
but every twist

34:31.250 --> 34:31.760
and insertion

34:31.760 --> 34:33.159
requires precise skill.

34:33.840 --> 34:34.440
Since my father

34:34.440 --> 34:35.790
agreed to save Ning Fei,

34:35.920 --> 34:37.760
he's definitely not going to die.

34:37.760 --> 34:39.520
Didn't Lord Ling just say

34:39.590 --> 34:41.120
this man couldn't be saved?

34:41.190 --> 34:42.480
Did I say he'd survive?

34:42.760 --> 34:43.710
I've only temporarily sealed

34:43.710 --> 34:44.710
his heart meridian

34:44.710 --> 34:46.639
to control the poison in his blood.

34:46.670 --> 34:47.320
To put it plainly,

34:47.320 --> 34:49.179
I'm just buying him two more days.

34:49.230 --> 34:49.840
That's impossible.

34:49.840 --> 34:51.000
Nothing is impossible.

34:51.000 --> 34:52.290
I don't do miracles.

34:52.800 --> 34:53.550
When I say he can't be saved,

34:53.550 --> 34:54.580
he can't be saved.

34:54.710 --> 34:55.969
Would I lie about that?

34:57.280 --> 34:58.280
If he can't be saved,

34:58.280 --> 34:59.440
why make him live two more days?

34:59.440 --> 34:59.980
Just because I can't

34:59.980 --> 35:01.580
save him doesn't mean no one…

35:02.480 --> 35:03.210
can save him.

35:04.960 --> 35:05.890
Who can save him?

35:07.110 --> 35:08.840
There is a place where they have

35:08.840 --> 35:11.040
a secret blood replacement technique.

35:11.360 --> 35:12.620
It might save his life.

35:13.510 --> 35:14.660
Where is that place?

35:15.480 --> 35:16.550
It's located outside the borders

35:16.550 --> 35:17.960
of Susha and Jinxiu.

35:18.400 --> 35:19.930
Ordinary people can't even

35:20.150 --> 35:21.670
hear of this secret place,

35:21.760 --> 35:23.660
let alone get in.

35:25.360 --> 35:26.500
They have a rule—

35:27.320 --> 35:28.400
anyone who enters

35:28.800 --> 35:30.060
must become one of them

35:30.320 --> 35:31.520
and swear a blood oath

35:31.840 --> 35:33.570
to never betray them or escape.

35:35.030 --> 35:35.550
Father,

35:36.190 --> 35:37.990
how do you know about this place?

35:41.000 --> 35:42.510
I once saved one of those people

35:42.510 --> 35:43.550
in the woods.

35:44.760 --> 35:46.490
That's how I knew their secret.

35:48.880 --> 35:49.440
Miss,

35:50.280 --> 35:51.610
are you sure about this?

35:51.920 --> 35:53.440
If you send your brother there,

35:53.440 --> 35:54.610
even if he's saved,

35:54.840 --> 35:56.700
he'll likely never be free again.

36:07.550 --> 36:08.280
I'm sure.

36:09.370 --> 36:10.840
Being alive is more important
than anything.

36:10.840 --> 36:11.400
I agree.

36:11.840 --> 36:13.110
I agree to any condition.

36:13.110 --> 36:13.640
Alright.

36:14.030 --> 36:15.150
Does he have any blood relatives?

36:15.150 --> 36:15.880
The contract

36:15.880 --> 36:17.630
requires a handprint
from a close relative.

36:17.630 --> 36:18.490
He's an orphan.

36:18.760 --> 36:20.220
I'm the only family he has.

36:21.110 --> 36:22.140
That's a problem.

36:22.280 --> 36:23.410
What's the problem?

36:23.480 --> 36:24.480
It's just a handprint.

36:24.480 --> 36:25.080
I'll do it.

36:25.360 --> 36:26.280
If you put your handprint,

36:26.280 --> 36:27.030
you'll be

36:27.070 --> 36:28.150
the guarantor.

36:28.510 --> 36:29.760
Their rules are strict.

36:29.760 --> 36:30.590
What they say goes.

36:30.590 --> 36:31.670
If your brother escapes,

36:31.670 --> 36:33.030
you'll need to bring him back.

36:33.030 --> 36:34.210
If you can't,

36:34.280 --> 36:35.110
you'll have to repay

36:35.110 --> 36:36.630
the debt of gratitude in his place.

36:36.630 --> 36:37.430
I understand.

36:38.000 --> 36:39.230
Who's going to draft the contract?

36:39.230 --> 36:40.490
You don't understand.

36:40.710 --> 36:42.760
They are going to save his life.

36:42.960 --> 36:43.760
If he runs,

36:43.960 --> 36:45.320
you'll have to give your life
in his place.

36:45.320 --> 36:45.930
I know.

36:46.030 --> 36:47.360
I'm willing to bear all consequences.

36:47.360 --> 36:48.030
Father,

36:48.110 --> 36:48.800
what kind of place is that?

36:48.800 --> 36:49.480
Why does it have

36:49.480 --> 36:50.840
even more rules than our Zhengnian Villa?

36:50.840 --> 36:51.960
What do you know?

36:52.760 --> 36:54.110
If people there are willing to help,

36:54.110 --> 36:55.630
except for those already claimed by death,

36:55.630 --> 36:57.090
they can save anyone.

36:57.590 --> 36:58.260
Father,

36:58.590 --> 37:00.190
that doesn't sound like you.

37:00.190 --> 37:01.000
In all my life,

37:01.030 --> 37:02.920
I've never seen you admit
someone else is better.

37:02.920 --> 37:04.580
Then you haven't seen enough.

37:05.060 --> 37:06.390
Draft the contract now.

37:06.670 --> 37:09.070
I'm afraid
Ning Fei won't last much longer.

37:23.410 --> 37:24.470
What are you doing?

37:24.580 --> 37:25.990
Making Xia Jingshi and the others

37:25.990 --> 37:27.670
believe that Ning Fei is already dead.

37:27.670 --> 37:29.000
It makes things easier.

37:29.760 --> 37:31.220
Once he leaves this place,

37:31.360 --> 37:33.710
he'll no longer be involved
in worldly conflicts.

37:33.710 --> 37:35.240
Jinxiu and Susha

37:35.360 --> 37:37.590
will have nothing to do with him anymore.

37:37.590 --> 37:38.480
This is probably

37:38.480 --> 37:39.810
the best ending for him.

37:41.480 --> 37:42.180
Thank you.

37:43.150 --> 37:43.670
Miss,

37:45.590 --> 37:46.990
I've taken the contract.

37:47.590 --> 37:48.110
From this day on,

37:48.110 --> 37:49.640
you'll be held accountable

37:50.150 --> 37:50.920
for everything

37:50.920 --> 37:51.890
this man does.

37:52.190 --> 37:52.920
Don't worry.

37:53.710 --> 37:55.240
We're not related by blood,

37:55.280 --> 37:56.880
but we'll be family for life.

37:57.150 --> 37:58.880
As long as he's alive, that's enough.

37:58.880 --> 37:59.410
Alright.

38:01.000 --> 38:01.710
I'll draw you a map in a bit

38:01.710 --> 38:03.000
and show you the location.

38:03.000 --> 38:03.630
Once your people

38:03.630 --> 38:04.630
send him there,

38:04.670 --> 38:05.630
they'll take him

38:05.630 --> 38:07.090
after they see the letter.

38:07.110 --> 38:07.750
Remember—

38:07.880 --> 38:09.030
when your people arrive,

38:09.030 --> 38:10.430
they must be blindfolded

38:10.510 --> 38:12.310
and ask no questions at any time.

38:12.950 --> 38:13.680
Understood.

38:20.550 --> 38:24.350
[Jingming Garden]

38:22.190 --> 38:23.270
Thank you for coming in person,

38:23.270 --> 38:24.570
Minister Shen.

38:26.200 --> 38:27.060
Minister Shen.

38:28.670 --> 38:31.670
I've brought the man.

38:36.090 --> 38:38.630
[Jingming Garden]

38:38.360 --> 38:40.500
On behalf of His Highness,

38:40.630 --> 38:41.800
I thank you.

39:08.000 --> 39:08.860
Your Highness.

39:09.800 --> 39:10.860
Aren't you curious

39:11.630 --> 39:13.440
why Feng Suige let you return?

39:15.110 --> 39:16.990
Susha had promised

39:17.110 --> 39:18.370
to return Yixiao to me.

39:19.110 --> 39:20.830
But I gave that spot to you.

39:23.030 --> 39:24.630
You shouldn't have saved me.

39:24.670 --> 39:26.200
I shouldn't have saved you?

39:27.190 --> 39:28.390
If I hadn't saved you,

39:28.590 --> 39:30.250
should I have just let you die?

39:31.320 --> 39:33.150
Better I kill you myself

39:35.060 --> 39:37.140
than let Feng Suige do it!

40:00.000 --> 40:01.340
What did you do wrong?

40:04.280 --> 40:05.890
I failed to kill Yixiao.

40:08.920 --> 40:10.250
Do you have a death wish?

40:10.280 --> 40:11.140
Your Highness,

40:11.290 --> 40:12.690
Yixiao cannot be spared.

40:14.030 --> 40:15.630
She's forgotten everything.

40:15.630 --> 40:16.280
She was about

40:16.280 --> 40:17.320
to come back to me.

40:17.760 --> 40:19.220
Why did you act on your own?

40:19.360 --> 40:21.030
Why did you ruin everything?

40:22.000 --> 40:23.010
She already knows

40:23.320 --> 40:25.650
you were the one
who shot her off the cliff.

40:26.070 --> 40:27.040
She also knows

40:27.350 --> 40:29.110
I sent assassins after her.

40:29.400 --> 40:30.360
You know better than anyone

40:30.360 --> 40:31.620
how capable Yixiao is.

40:32.050 --> 40:33.140
If she lives,

40:33.590 --> 40:35.280
she'll be a threat to you.

40:43.610 --> 40:45.070
You're in no position

40:45.070 --> 40:46.470
to make decisions for me.

40:47.110 --> 40:47.970
Your Highness.

40:48.660 --> 40:49.630
I just couldn't bear

40:49.630 --> 40:51.190
to see you backed into a corner again.

40:51.190 --> 40:52.030
Everything I've done

40:52.030 --> 40:53.230
was all for you!

40:53.440 --> 40:54.460
You resent me.

40:56.280 --> 40:57.260
I don't dare.

40:58.320 --> 41:00.450
You resent me for going back on my word.

41:00.630 --> 41:03.090
You resent me
for failing to protect Yixiao.

41:03.220 --> 41:04.580
Yixiao is your family.

41:05.910 --> 41:08.170
How could you bring yourself to kill her?

41:12.550 --> 41:13.480
It's all my fault

41:14.550 --> 41:16.180
that you ended up like this.

41:16.430 --> 41:17.020
No!

41:17.710 --> 41:18.590
When we chose to follow you,

41:18.590 --> 41:19.520
we swore an oath.

41:20.590 --> 41:21.280
Our lives

41:22.090 --> 41:23.190
belong to you.

41:27.170 --> 41:28.020
Leave now.

41:30.070 --> 41:31.320
You've been exposed.

41:32.520 --> 41:34.510
Feng Suige will definitely have people

41:34.510 --> 41:35.960
watching you.

41:36.830 --> 41:38.070
Go to the border now

41:38.510 --> 41:39.430
and gather men.

41:39.730 --> 41:41.460
Once I find a way to escape,

41:43.150 --> 41:44.550
you'll be there waiting.

41:46.230 --> 41:46.760
Yes.

42:13.960 --> 42:18.610
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

42:20.360 --> 42:21.250
Where exactly are you

42:21.250 --> 42:22.250
sending Ning Fei?

42:24.190 --> 42:25.250
Don't ask too much.

42:25.510 --> 42:26.360
When it's time for you to know,

42:26.360 --> 42:27.230
you'll know.

42:26.390 --> 42:27.020
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

42:29.150 --> 42:30.210
Does it have something to do

42:30.210 --> 42:31.370
with my mother?

42:31.760 --> 42:33.730
I said don't ask.

42:34.640 --> 42:36.050
What's that girl to you?

42:36.710 --> 42:39.030
She's Fu Yixiao,
the Red-Clad General of Jinxiu,

42:39.030 --> 42:40.160
who nearly killed me

42:40.280 --> 42:42.480
with an arrow at the Battle of Pingling.

42:42.760 --> 42:43.760
An enemy?

42:45.590 --> 42:46.990
She used to be.

42:47.190 --> 42:47.800
And now?
